{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>חצני</b> — my arm, or the edge of a garment is called חוצן." "<b>נערתי</b> — from וינער ה' את מצרים (Exodus 14:27, 'and YHWH shook off Egypt')." "<b>מביתו</b> — from his sons." "<b>ויהללו את ה'</b> — because they set it in their hearts to do so."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:07.842172858Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}